+## Background (minimal)
+
+Upstream evidence (details in [reassessment](./conference-srd-native-domain-partition-architecture-reassessment.md)):
+
+```text
+1 Factory + N PC     鈫?shared native SRD domain 鈫?original P0.1g NOT satisfied
+2 Factory + 1 ADM    鈫?construction crash       鈫?D-伪 REJECTED
