+D-纬                  鈫?LONG-TERM OPTION 路 NOT AUTHORIZED
+B2-1                 鈫?RETAIN (ownership 路 admission 路 failure visibility)
+```
+
+No verified safe per-edge native isolation path exists on current `stream-webrtc-android:1.3.10` / Android runtime / existing audio architecture.
+
+**Wording constraint (frozen):** Use `BLOCKED / NO VERIFIED PATH`, not `BLOCKED BY RUNTIME CAPABILITY` (D-尾 not disproven).
+
+**Anchor Media Domain rename:** Does **not** remove native coupling while `1 Factory + N PC` remains. Logical topology domain 鈮?runtime fault domain.
